        "original_id": "d755fa1b-3e84-5e68-96f8-abef76804ff3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lisa Raymond, Liezel Huber, Cara Black, Bob Bryan\n- Sports: tennis, Grand Slam titles\n- Roles: women's doubles players, mixed doubles players\n\nFacts:\n- Liezel Huber was born as Liezel Horn on 21 August 1976.\n- Liezel Huber is a South African-American retired tennis player who represented the United States internationally.\n- Lisa Raymond has won 11 Grand Slam titles, including 6 in women's doubles and 5 in mixed doubles.\n- Liezel Huber won four Grand Slam women's doubles titles with Cara Black.\n- Liezel Huber won one Grand Slam women's doubles title with Lisa Raymond.\n- Liezel Huber won two Grand Slam mixed doubles titles with Bob Bryan.",
